WEBVTT

00:20.875 --> 00:22.500
This is a warning.

00:32.541 --> 00:33.750
Shimura?

00:35.416 --> 00:36.333
Shimura!

00:36.875 --> 00:37.791
Shimura!

00:40.583 --> 00:41.666
Aki.

00:44.166 --> 00:45.333
Are you okay?

00:47.666 --> 00:49.416
I wasn't much of a fighter.

00:50.125 --> 00:51.333
At least you're okay.

00:51.416 --> 00:52.916
We've other issues now.

00:55.458 --> 00:56.291
A warning?

00:56.375 --> 00:58.041
But why Shimura?

00:58.125 --> 01:00.958
Someone's jealous because we're popular,
so they attack Shimura?

01:01.041 --> 01:02.291
Maybe.

01:03.833 --> 01:05.458
You reek of alcohol.

01:05.958 --> 01:08.083
Oh, no. You're imagining things.

01:08.166 --> 01:09.541
I'm underage, you know?

01:09.625 --> 01:11.208
I tell you what…

01:11.291 --> 01:13.958
if something like this happens again,
then next time I'm gonna--

01:14.041 --> 01:15.208
It's very fishy.

01:15.291 --> 01:16.791
Do I smell that bad?

01:16.875 --> 01:18.583
These events are too coincidental.

01:18.666 --> 01:19.750
I agree.

01:19.833 --> 01:23.291
It's likely that the hacker
and your attackers are the same guys.

01:23.375 --> 01:24.583
Oh, now I get it.

01:24.666 --> 01:26.041
But how did they do it?

01:26.125 --> 01:28.583
Our username and passwords
are very secure.

01:28.666 --> 01:30.083
It beats me too.

01:30.583 --> 01:33.458
Unless somehow,
they got their hands on our password.

01:33.541 --> 01:34.708
But how?

01:37.250 --> 01:38.791
-Kanegon.
-Hmm?

01:38.875 --> 01:41.875
You didn't fall for some phishing scheme
on a porn site, did you?

01:41.958 --> 01:44.583
Oh, come on.
I'm not a pervert or anything.

01:46.208 --> 01:49.583
Hey, Kanegon. Show us how you edit.

01:49.666 --> 01:50.625
You really wanna know?

01:50.708 --> 01:52.416
-Yes!
-No. Wait, really?

01:52.500 --> 01:54.083
Okay.

01:54.166 --> 01:55.583
Oh, this is so great.

01:55.666 --> 01:58.791
-Let me see, V-I-R-A-L.
-Viral.

01:58.875 --> 02:03.083
-H-I-and-T
-Ah!

02:03.166 --> 02:04.583
Don't forget the password.

02:04.666 --> 02:06.708
K-K-D…

02:06.791 --> 02:07.833
Oh.

02:07.916 --> 02:09.916
Hmm? What's wrong?

02:10.000 --> 02:11.000
Oh no.

02:12.125 --> 02:13.250
It's nothing

02:17.833 --> 02:20.208
HIGH SCHOOL

02:23.458 --> 02:26.625
-Oh, hi. I had a great time last night--
-I'm sure you did.

02:26.708 --> 02:30.041
-If you want the girls' info--
-The password!

02:31.166 --> 02:32.291
You stole it.

02:33.041 --> 02:34.166
What? I don't know.

02:34.666 --> 02:37.125
-You're making things up.
-Don't play dumb with me.

02:37.208 --> 02:40.333
You got our account suspended
and you had those guys ambush Shimura.

02:40.416 --> 02:42.583
What do you mean?
What are you accusing me of?

02:42.666 --> 02:44.083
I don't have time for this.

02:45.250 --> 02:48.666
Recently, I joined an agency. So I'm busy.

02:48.750 --> 02:51.125
-Have a good day.
-Hey! Wait, you…

02:53.166 --> 02:54.666
God dammit!

02:55.500 --> 02:57.333
What am I going to do?

02:59.291 --> 03:00.625
-Good work today.
-You too.

03:02.041 --> 03:04.125
-What happened to you?
-Huh?

03:04.208 --> 03:05.458
Your head.

03:06.375 --> 03:07.833
Oh, this.

03:08.833 --> 03:10.000
Did you fight again?

03:10.083 --> 03:13.166
Uh, no, I didn't. I got ambushed.

03:13.250 --> 03:14.791
It was two against one.

03:14.875 --> 03:16.125
I didn't stand a chance.

03:16.208 --> 03:17.666
Who did this to you?

03:17.750 --> 03:20.208
I don't know. But, don't worry.

03:20.291 --> 03:21.916
Next time, they don't stand a chance.

03:24.041 --> 03:27.791
Oh, here.
I forgot to return this. Thank you.

03:27.875 --> 03:29.500
Oh, thank you.

03:36.541 --> 03:38.250
Uh, can I…

03:38.333 --> 03:39.375
Huh?

03:39.458 --> 03:43.000
Oh, yeah.
I was wondering about our café date.

03:43.083 --> 03:45.000
Ah!

03:45.083 --> 03:46.250
I'll let you know, yeah?

03:47.291 --> 03:50.250
-Well, better get back to it.
-Yeah, I'll be right there.

03:57.041 --> 03:58.208
I KNOW WHO DID IT

03:58.291 --> 03:59.541
Kanegon?

04:02.666 --> 04:07.500
Hey, so I heard
that Viral Hit's account got hacked.

04:08.041 --> 04:09.250
Really?

04:09.333 --> 04:11.125
Mr. Kimishima, was that you?

04:11.208 --> 04:13.333
And why would I do that?

04:14.208 --> 04:17.083
Anyway, this is good.
Now you don't have them to worry about.

04:18.250 --> 04:19.208
Hmm.

04:20.166 --> 04:23.625
But… I really want more followers.

04:23.708 --> 04:25.875
Oh, I know.

04:28.041 --> 04:32.708
I told you.
I'll do anything for you, Rumi. Hmm?

04:33.666 --> 04:35.000
Mm-hmm.

04:46.000 --> 04:47.625
Influencer agency?

04:47.708 --> 04:50.166
Yeah. Rumi recently joined an agency.

04:50.250 --> 04:51.375
That's it there.

04:52.666 --> 04:55.083
CANDY CROWN
CREATOR

04:55.833 --> 04:59.083
-There she is.
-Not the point. Keep scrolling down.

05:04.083 --> 05:06.250
Hey! These are the guys who attacked me.

05:06.333 --> 05:07.833
Yeah, I thought so.

05:08.333 --> 05:10.500
Now all the dots are connected.

05:10.583 --> 05:14.166
We need to solve this quickly
so I can redeem myself to Aki.

05:14.250 --> 05:15.958
Redeem yourself? Why?

05:17.875 --> 05:21.708
-What's Aki got to do with…
-Come on! You know I have a crush on her.

05:22.833 --> 05:26.458
-No.
-Hey, you haven't figured that out yet?

05:26.541 --> 05:27.916
Uh, no.

05:28.000 --> 05:31.333
Jeez. We need an emergency meeting now.

05:32.083 --> 05:33.583
At Aki's!

05:34.291 --> 05:35.458
Come on!

05:36.750 --> 05:38.750
How long has this been going on?

05:39.250 --> 05:40.083
PINGURI

05:40.166 --> 05:44.583
They've got 600 subscribers who post
videos doing obnoxious shit in public.

05:44.666 --> 05:47.916
And you think it was Rumi
who had them attack me, right?

05:48.000 --> 05:50.958
She denied it, but there's
no doubt they're connected.

05:51.458 --> 05:53.791
They got hold of my password
after she stole it.

05:53.875 --> 05:57.875
Mmm. Let's go to police.
There's no doubt that this is a crime.

05:59.083 --> 06:00.750
I know where you're coming from,

06:00.833 --> 06:04.083
but if we do that, our channel,
it could get taken down.

06:06.208 --> 06:08.291
Young people are flocking
to the streaming app

06:08.375 --> 06:09.791
that we've been using.

06:09.875 --> 06:12.750
But since it's so new,
there's no oversight.

06:12.833 --> 06:14.250
That's how we do what we do.

06:15.083 --> 06:17.791
If they find out
we're making money by using violence,

06:17.875 --> 06:20.208
they'll ban our account immediately.

06:20.708 --> 06:23.000
So, what are you saying?
We should forget it?

06:23.083 --> 06:27.791
We've just found our next opponent.

06:28.833 --> 06:32.125
They trapped you, they think,
but you allowed it. Didn't you?

06:33.125 --> 06:36.041
Hang on a sec.
There are two of them, yeah?

06:36.125 --> 06:38.416
I was off my guard when they attacked.

06:38.916 --> 06:42.500
We'll be bringing down streamers
who attack members of the public.

06:43.125 --> 06:45.208
Good content, it'll make money.

06:46.833 --> 06:49.166
HOW TO BEAT A THUG IN A FIGHT

06:49.250 --> 06:51.666
Can I really win by listening to you?

07:00.083 --> 07:03.583
How am I supposed to fight
two guys at once?

07:06.666 --> 07:07.708
NEW VIDEO ALERT

07:10.958 --> 07:12.916
HOW TO WIN AGAINST MULTIPLE OPPONENTS

07:13.000 --> 07:15.666
Yes!

07:15.750 --> 07:19.541
What happens when a person
with zero training in martial arts

07:19.625 --> 07:22.916
attempts to fight
multiple opponents at once?

07:23.416 --> 07:25.666
He will never win.

07:25.750 --> 07:29.916
Yeah. But you're gonna show me
some new moves now, aren't you?

07:30.000 --> 07:32.791
If you are serious about winning,

07:32.875 --> 07:36.041
you must master
at least ten of my techniques.

07:36.125 --> 07:37.166
Ten? Wow.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.916
That's kind of a lot…

07:40.000 --> 07:42.208
That's right. In other words,

07:42.291 --> 07:45.375
there's no chance
for a beginner like you to win.

07:45.458 --> 07:47.833
You cannot win against multiple opponents.

07:47.916 --> 07:49.750
So give up.

07:49.833 --> 07:51.750
What? You serious?

07:51.833 --> 07:54.500
I… oh… come on! There's nothing?

07:54.583 --> 07:55.791
However,

07:55.875 --> 08:00.125
even if you can't win the fight,
you can still win the game.

08:02.125 --> 08:03.500
URABE GENERAL HOSPITAL

08:03.541 --> 08:06.625
I'm glad to hear
your son is enjoying school.

08:06.708 --> 08:08.666
I think he's made some good friends.

08:08.750 --> 08:10.500
He's been so lively lately.

08:10.583 --> 08:13.250
Your son is busy enjoying his age!

08:13.333 --> 08:14.916
He's already in high school.

08:15.000 --> 08:16.750
What if he starts dating someone?

08:16.833 --> 08:18.875
Now, we have a meeting at 10:00 today.

08:18.958 --> 08:19.791
Yes, I'm aware.

08:19.875 --> 08:21.125
Great work today.

08:21.916 --> 08:24.041
-Good morning.
-Hello, Director. Good morning.

08:24.666 --> 08:27.541
Oh, look, are you feeling better today?

08:27.625 --> 08:29.250
I have good and bad days.

08:29.750 --> 08:33.583
Don't worry. With us working together,
we'll beat this thing.

08:33.666 --> 08:35.625
-Thank you.
-Mm.

08:39.291 --> 08:41.625
The director's such a wonderful man.

08:45.916 --> 08:47.625
KABUKICHO

08:47.708 --> 08:48.750
Hello!

08:48.833 --> 08:51.083
-I'm Pink! Yeah!
-Green! Yeah!

08:51.166 --> 08:53.916
Tonight we're hitting the nightlife
to prank some people!

08:54.000 --> 08:54.875
Whoo!

08:54.958 --> 08:57.791
Which unsuspecting victim
will give us the best reaction?

08:57.875 --> 08:59.416
-It's showtime!
-Woo-hoo!

08:59.500 --> 09:01.916
-Hey, hey. What about that girl? Woo-hoo!
-Yo!

09:02.000 --> 09:03.500
-He went for it!
-So cute.

09:03.583 --> 09:05.375
-Yeah, he's gorgeous.
-Miss!

09:05.458 --> 09:07.333
There's a snake on you.

09:07.416 --> 09:09.208
Whoa! Oh my God!

09:09.291 --> 09:10.291
Just run!

09:10.375 --> 09:12.041
-Come on, run!
-Just run!

09:12.125 --> 09:13.625
Run some more!

09:14.458 --> 09:16.416
You bastards.

09:16.500 --> 09:19.458
That's quite enough of your bullshit.

09:23.416 --> 09:25.208
Time to go live.

09:27.458 --> 09:28.541
DID HE GET TALLER?

09:28.625 --> 09:29.916
IT'S A GROWTH SPURT LOL

09:31.291 --> 09:33.416
You're the guy from Viral Hit?

09:33.500 --> 09:35.208
Why the hell are you here?

09:36.750 --> 09:38.000
GET 'EM, SHIMURA! LOL

09:38.083 --> 09:39.000
TOO FUNNY LOL

09:39.083 --> 09:43.041
We're starting now.
The Viral Hit live stream.

09:48.708 --> 09:51.708
How to win against multiple opponents.

09:52.208 --> 09:55.375
The answer lies in your nature.

09:56.125 --> 09:59.333
It's bluff and intimidation.

10:00.125 --> 10:04.541
The bluff of a mantis,
fending off an attacker for survival!

10:05.166 --> 10:09.916
The intimidation of a gorilla defending
his rank in the hierarchy.

10:11.166 --> 10:15.125
Now, show them
that you can take them all on,

10:16.041 --> 10:18.333
even though you're alone.

10:18.416 --> 10:20.500
Last time you caught me off guard.

10:20.583 --> 10:24.291
I can take you both on. Not an issue.

10:24.375 --> 10:25.333
Heh!

10:25.416 --> 10:27.000
The bluff of a mantis!

10:27.666 --> 10:30.583
Give me the new password
and get the hell out of here…

10:30.666 --> 10:31.875
…or I'll kill both of you!

10:31.958 --> 10:33.791
Intimidation of a gorilla!

10:34.416 --> 10:36.375
Whoa, wait a minute.
We're already live, so…

10:36.458 --> 10:37.708
That's right.

10:39.250 --> 10:40.333
However,

10:40.416 --> 10:43.458
you must never forget this one point.

10:43.541 --> 10:46.416
Don't ever let your opponent catch on…

10:48.208 --> 10:50.791
…to your bluff and intimidation.

10:52.166 --> 10:53.875
-You idiot. What are you doing?
-I just…

10:53.958 --> 10:56.458
Hey, wait a minute. Look at this.

10:57.083 --> 10:59.708
His shoes are full of all these insoles.

11:01.958 --> 11:03.291
Dipshit.

11:03.791 --> 11:05.500
Do you think
we're dumb or something? Huh?

11:05.583 --> 11:07.875
-Hey! Hey!
-Don't mess with us.

11:08.875 --> 11:11.916
Damn it. I can't hear
the master's voice anymore.

11:12.000 --> 11:13.166
What should I do?

11:13.250 --> 11:15.166
-What's this? What's this!
-Stop it. I said stop!

11:15.250 --> 11:17.000
Come on! Show me!

11:17.083 --> 11:18.541
-We're gone.
-Show me!

11:18.625 --> 11:20.708
Look at his shoulder!

11:20.791 --> 11:22.833
It's all padded. It's fake!

11:22.916 --> 11:24.333
SHOULDER PADS ARE SO 80S

11:24.416 --> 11:25.500
THIS IS HILARIOUS

11:25.583 --> 11:26.625
He's such a loser!

11:31.208 --> 11:33.916
I can't stand your type of person.

11:34.875 --> 11:36.083
It's time.

11:36.166 --> 11:38.250
Beatdown time!

11:38.333 --> 11:39.666
Ah!

11:39.750 --> 11:40.875
Don't mess with us.

11:40.958 --> 11:42.625
Take…

11:45.250 --> 11:46.750
Damn it! That hurt, you bastard!

11:49.791 --> 11:52.500
I don't know. Something's wrong with me.

11:52.583 --> 11:53.833
Ah! Take it!

11:53.916 --> 11:55.666
-This is bad.
-Just wait.

11:55.750 --> 11:56.916
Yes!

12:02.583 --> 12:04.666
-What's happening to me?
-Wait! Hey!

12:06.375 --> 12:07.541
Come on!

12:07.625 --> 12:09.750
Hey! Wait!

12:10.625 --> 12:11.708
Hey!

12:11.791 --> 12:14.000
You're going nowhere! Hey!

12:14.500 --> 12:16.750
-Wait!
-I'm scared to death.

12:18.250 --> 12:21.291
But at the same time, kinda pumped.

12:25.458 --> 12:30.291
VIRAL HIT

12:37.583 --> 12:39.125
Wait up!

12:39.208 --> 12:40.291
Damn it!

12:41.750 --> 12:44.291
Bastard! Stop running away! Hey!

12:44.375 --> 12:47.625
Ah! Ah!

12:52.708 --> 12:54.666
Catch him! Hey! Hey!

12:56.416 --> 12:58.125
Get over here, bastard.

13:00.416 --> 13:03.083
Hey, stop!

13:03.166 --> 13:04.500
-Hey!
-Look out!

13:13.708 --> 13:16.541
Calf kick! Calf kick!

13:18.375 --> 13:21.708
Wait! Hey, you! Come back!

13:32.833 --> 13:34.750
You have to let it go!

13:36.583 --> 13:38.750
Calf kick!

13:39.250 --> 13:42.125
Ow!

13:42.208 --> 13:44.208
Ugh! That really hurt.

13:44.291 --> 13:45.916
You bastard.

13:46.875 --> 13:48.541
I won't forgive you!

13:48.625 --> 13:50.583
That's enough!

13:53.000 --> 13:54.791
The match is over, can't you see?

13:55.416 --> 13:57.958
Huh? Who the hell are you?

13:59.041 --> 14:02.375
You know much better than anyone
how exhausted you must be.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.583
Don't mess with us.

14:05.250 --> 14:08.958
-We're not leaving until this is finished.
-All right then, go ahead.

14:10.166 --> 14:13.375
That is, if you don't care
that you look like a couple of asses.

14:14.416 --> 14:15.750
MISSED THE BEST BIT LOL

14:15.833 --> 14:17.041
KEEP UP, CAMERAMAN!

14:21.500 --> 14:24.166
Hand over the password, then go home.

14:26.666 --> 14:27.791
Shit!

14:27.875 --> 14:29.958
Shit!

14:33.708 --> 14:35.083
PASSWORD CHANGE COMPLETE

14:35.166 --> 14:36.625
Everything's back to normal.

14:37.375 --> 14:38.875
I've changed the password again.

14:38.958 --> 14:42.125
Yeah! I didn't expect you
to put up a fight like this.

14:42.208 --> 14:44.916
When they started at you,
I thought you were done!

14:45.000 --> 14:50.166
Yes, that's right.
Well… have I just gone nuts?

14:51.541 --> 14:53.750
I don't fully understand it either.

14:53.833 --> 14:58.083
At some point,
I was afraid, but also fearless.

14:58.166 --> 15:01.583
Like… like I was pumped, you know?

15:01.666 --> 15:04.791
That's so great.
Main thing is you're okay.

15:04.875 --> 15:07.500
Maybe I'm not okay at all.

15:10.166 --> 15:13.500
Hello there. I apologize
to all of you about the recent suspension.

15:13.583 --> 15:15.291
-CONGRATS ON YOUR COMEBACK
-YOU WENT THROUGH HELL

15:15.375 --> 15:18.916
Our main channel was hijacked
by some nasty trolls.

15:19.416 --> 15:22.291
My recent fight you saw on the subchannel,

15:22.375 --> 15:24.625
you can now see on my main channel.

15:24.708 --> 15:27.875
Oh, and please, keep up the donations!

15:29.000 --> 15:30.250
Okay!

15:31.208 --> 15:32.541
Aki, how are the donations?

15:32.625 --> 15:35.250
-Fantastic donations pouring in.
-All right!

15:35.333 --> 15:37.708
You see, you can't do without me, can you?

15:37.791 --> 15:39.041
You've got a nerve, haven't you?

15:39.125 --> 15:41.250
You're the one
who got us into this trouble.

15:41.333 --> 15:42.916
Yeah, sorry about that.

15:44.958 --> 15:48.458
Kanegon.
What's next for us then?

15:58.250 --> 16:00.458
Hey, when are you gonna quit?

16:00.541 --> 16:01.500
Move, damn it!

16:02.166 --> 16:03.250
K.O.

16:06.000 --> 16:07.166
I died.

16:07.250 --> 16:09.875
Your turn's over. Over! Now move it!

16:09.958 --> 16:10.833
Go!

16:14.000 --> 16:16.083
What, punk? Wanna go?

16:16.166 --> 16:18.750
What are you, Viral Hit 2.0?

16:21.541 --> 16:23.125
Give me 100.

16:23.208 --> 16:24.208
What?

16:34.000 --> 16:35.291
VIRAL HIT

16:37.291 --> 16:39.458
VIRAL HIT
#3 RECOMMENDED VIDEO

16:41.500 --> 16:42.791
You little rat!

16:42.875 --> 16:47.291
VIRAL HIT
#1 TOP PICK VIDEO

16:49.708 --> 16:51.375
Viral Hit.

16:57.833 --> 16:59.500
I'll put your fresh clothes here.

16:59.583 --> 17:00.666
Thank you.

17:01.750 --> 17:05.833
-Say, have you heard of streamers?
-What?

17:05.916 --> 17:09.833
Kids these days want to be streamers
when they grow up. It says it, just look.

17:11.708 --> 17:13.166
Is that right?

17:14.333 --> 17:15.583
#1 DREAM JOB FOR BOYS:
STREAMER

17:15.666 --> 17:17.958
Oh, but I'm not into that.

17:18.041 --> 17:21.375
Of course not. Why would people want
to watch streaming of you?

17:21.458 --> 17:22.666
Ah, you're right.

17:22.750 --> 17:25.875
Oh, maybe I should give it a try.

17:25.958 --> 17:27.750
And who's gonna watch that?

17:27.833 --> 17:30.666
Oh, I think I'd be pretty good at it.

17:30.750 --> 17:33.875
Like a mother fighting off a disease.

17:36.958 --> 17:38.416
Just curious.

17:39.250 --> 17:41.958
What do you think now
that you've read about them?

17:43.791 --> 17:44.666
Why do you ask?

17:45.375 --> 17:48.291
Oh. Like I said, just curious.

17:50.083 --> 17:52.500
I don't see anything wrong with it.

17:53.708 --> 17:57.166
But… I'd be worried as a parent.

17:58.791 --> 18:02.541
I'd rather my child work
a normal job like you do now.

18:04.500 --> 18:05.791
I see.

18:07.708 --> 18:10.958
Oh. It's time for me to get going.

18:11.041 --> 18:13.625
-So busy! Working again?
-No.

18:14.833 --> 18:16.708
There's just something I need to do.

18:16.791 --> 18:18.625
You seeing a girl?

18:18.708 --> 18:21.666
Oh, of course not. No, you're wrong!

18:21.750 --> 18:24.166
Aw. That's too bad.

18:30.208 --> 18:31.541
VIRAL HIT

18:31.625 --> 18:35.458
Viral Hit is looking for fighters.
Refer yourself or others.

18:35.541 --> 18:37.791
All right, it's uploaded.

18:37.875 --> 18:41.500
Oh, look!
It's already got views.

18:42.333 --> 18:43.958
Where's Shimura today?

18:44.458 --> 18:47.208
Who knows?
He said he was busy or something.

18:47.750 --> 18:48.750
Is he working?

18:48.833 --> 18:50.041
Don't think so.

18:51.083 --> 18:54.291
-Oh.
-He's seeing Asamiya.

18:54.375 --> 18:57.041
He was all serious,
saying he had to see her today.

18:57.125 --> 18:59.166
I think it might be a date.

19:02.458 --> 19:07.041
And, you know, it's…
just the two of us here now. Isn't it?

19:07.125 --> 19:09.833
Aren't you nervous, you know?

19:09.916 --> 19:12.416
Uh…

19:14.500 --> 19:17.916
So, Aki… do you have a boyfriend?

19:21.125 --> 19:23.291
Don't you dare
lay a finger on my daughter.

19:23.375 --> 19:24.416
KYOTO VEGETABLE MIBUNA
BUBUZUKE

19:24.500 --> 19:26.750
Oh, I would never.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.666
Well, I don't think I trust you.

19:29.750 --> 19:31.791
Oh, that's silly.
What are you talking about, Dad?

19:31.875 --> 19:32.750
Dad?

19:33.375 --> 19:34.250
Aki.

19:34.833 --> 19:38.291
I'm glad that you made friends,
but why do you only bring men around here?

19:38.375 --> 19:40.291
Oh, shut up and get back to work.

19:42.833 --> 19:44.666
Deh!

19:44.750 --> 19:46.041
Hey!

19:50.375 --> 19:51.291
Sorry.

19:51.375 --> 19:53.416
It's okay.

19:54.000 --> 19:57.541
I guess you guys are, um, used to
joking around with each other, yeah?

19:57.625 --> 20:01.125
Uh… he was deadly serious.

20:02.041 --> 20:03.166
Oh, I see.

20:04.208 --> 20:06.541
Where did you live when you were overseas?

20:06.625 --> 20:07.875
We were in the US.

20:07.958 --> 20:10.250
Yeah? That's really great.

20:10.750 --> 20:12.958
Dad's work took us there for 12 years.

20:13.041 --> 20:15.041
It… was tough.

20:52.125 --> 20:54.166
Thank you for paying. Hope it was okay.

20:54.250 --> 20:56.916
It was my way
to thank you for the other day.

20:57.000 --> 20:58.250
That's nice!

20:59.083 --> 21:00.375
Parfait was great!

21:00.458 --> 21:03.083
Mm. You wanted to talk?

21:03.583 --> 21:04.875
Something on your mind?

21:05.583 --> 21:08.250
Oh, right. Uh, yes.

21:08.750 --> 21:11.125
Now I can't make myself ask it.

21:12.166 --> 21:13.666
Asamiya-san…

21:14.958 --> 21:17.416
-Your house, it's fancy.
-Huh?

21:17.500 --> 21:19.625
What the hell am I saying?

21:20.250 --> 21:21.958
Actually, the other day,

21:22.458 --> 21:25.166
I followed you
to return your handkerchief.

21:25.833 --> 21:28.541
Uh, I…I wasn't trying to stalk you.

21:28.625 --> 21:30.333
Mm, I understand.

21:30.958 --> 21:35.166
It just… felt like you and I…
are kind of different.

21:36.083 --> 21:38.875
Your dad must be a very important person.

21:38.958 --> 21:41.791
That's not true. He's fairly normal.

21:41.875 --> 21:43.666
I wondered why you worked part-time.

21:43.750 --> 21:45.541
What's so weird about that?

21:45.625 --> 21:47.708
I guess nothing.

21:47.791 --> 21:49.375
So that was it?

21:49.458 --> 21:50.333
Oh.

21:51.625 --> 21:54.666
No. Not entirely.

21:56.625 --> 21:58.083
.

22:18.333 --> 22:19.666
Another time, I think.

22:21.666 --> 22:22.958
Mm. Okay, then.

22:37.708 --> 22:39.791
Guys!

22:41.583 --> 22:43.375
I found your next opponent.

22:43.458 --> 22:44.375
Really, who is it?

22:44.458 --> 22:45.833
Shinjo Reo.

22:46.333 --> 22:47.916
He's a Tae kwon do champion.

22:48.458 --> 22:49.458
Tae kwon do?

22:49.541 --> 22:53.125
The thought of you facing off with him
is sending the viewers crazy!

22:54.416 --> 22:57.458
He's a high school dropout
and notorious troublemaker.

22:58.250 --> 23:01.750
They say that he smashes
his wristwatch every fight.

23:02.541 --> 23:04.083
It's a hot matchup.

23:04.166 --> 23:06.833
The buzz will be huge
and think of the donations.

23:06.916 --> 23:08.875
-Wait a minute, I--
-It's too dangerous.

23:09.458 --> 23:11.791
It's reckless
taking on a skilled guy like that.

23:11.875 --> 23:13.000
I agree.

23:13.083 --> 23:15.458
Sorry, but that's how it is.

23:15.541 --> 23:18.000
The reason the viewers are so hyped…

23:19.416 --> 23:21.083
is 'cause he volunteered himself!

23:21.166 --> 23:22.041
@REOSHINJO FIGHT ME

23:25.750 --> 23:26.583
IT'S HIM!

23:26.666 --> 23:27.875
SHINJO FOUND YOU!

23:27.958 --> 23:28.875
GAME OVER LOL

23:28.958 --> 23:29.791
No way.

23:36.541 --> 23:38.083
-Asamiya?
-Yeah?

23:40.250 --> 23:41.833
Did you see this?

23:41.916 --> 23:43.750
VIRAL HIT'S HOT GIRLFRIEND!

23:43.833 --> 23:45.833
Oh, that's us.

23:45.916 --> 23:47.708
Someone managed to figure it out

23:47.791 --> 23:51.625
from the video of you
on Hamaken TV and Viral Hit.

23:52.500 --> 23:53.583
FOUND TRUE BEAUTY!

23:53.666 --> 23:54.500
WIFE MATERIAL

23:54.583 --> 23:56.166
You should be careful.

23:56.666 --> 23:59.916
Let me know if any weirdos come in.
I'll tell the manager.

24:00.625 --> 24:01.500
Yeah.

24:03.958 --> 24:06.500
Don't let
these test results bring you down.

24:06.583 --> 24:09.333
Your numbers will improve again.

24:10.875 --> 24:13.333
-Whoa!! Awesome!
-He won again!

24:13.416 --> 24:15.875
Sh! Boys! Keep it down. We're in hospital.

24:15.958 --> 24:17.375
It's okay.

24:18.625 --> 24:21.708
Oh, that looks fun. What are you watching?

24:21.791 --> 24:22.666
Viral Hit.

24:22.750 --> 24:24.666
He's super popular.

24:24.750 --> 24:26.833
So, this is what kids are into these days?

24:27.416 --> 24:29.708
I'm gonna be a streamer when I grow up.

24:29.791 --> 24:32.750
Very good. I hope you will. Mm.

24:32.833 --> 24:36.000
-Thank you so much. Thank you.
-Oh! Awesome punching!

24:42.208 --> 24:43.625
ASAMIYA: THAT WAS FUN

24:43.708 --> 24:44.583
SEE YOU AT WORK

24:48.166 --> 24:49.041
Hi there.

24:49.125 --> 24:50.625
Shimura, where are you?

24:50.708 --> 24:52.833
I'm heading off to work. Why?

24:52.916 --> 24:54.500
Aki, she's in trouble!

24:59.791 --> 25:01.416
Don't make me repeat myself.

25:02.125 --> 25:03.666
Shimura will not fight you.

25:03.750 --> 25:05.083
I wasn't asking you.

25:05.166 --> 25:06.625
Aki, that's enough. Let's go.

25:06.708 --> 25:07.791
Let me go!

25:07.875 --> 25:11.416
You volunteered yourself
and now the viewers are egging us on.

25:11.500 --> 25:12.833
Withdraw your challenge.

25:12.916 --> 25:14.708
Don't tell me what to do.

25:15.208 --> 25:18.500
-Please, Aki, let's go home. Come on!
-Aki. Are you okay?

25:19.916 --> 25:21.041
Did you call him?

25:21.125 --> 25:22.875
-I'm sorry.
-You should be ashamed.

25:22.958 --> 25:24.166
Let's go home, Aki.

25:24.250 --> 25:25.416
Wait a second.

25:27.958 --> 25:28.875
Will you fight me?

25:32.166 --> 25:33.916
I'm sorry, but I won't.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.041
You're far too strong.

25:35.125 --> 25:36.000
Then…

25:39.666 --> 25:41.333
hand over your channel.

25:42.083 --> 25:43.166
Huh?

25:44.083 --> 25:46.208
Ah! Ah!

25:46.291 --> 25:49.583
-Kanegon!
-I know you're making bank.

25:51.916 --> 25:53.875
Give it to me.

25:55.541 --> 25:58.833
-What are you saying?
-Stop this!

25:58.916 --> 26:00.458
Ah! Ugh!

26:01.458 --> 26:04.208
Ugh! Ugh! Ugh!

26:07.541 --> 26:09.000
I said stop it!

26:18.875 --> 26:20.250
Hand it over.

26:20.750 --> 26:23.083
Stop it! You're gonna kill him!

26:26.291 --> 26:27.458
Let go of me!

26:39.750 --> 26:41.416
Okay! Okay, then.

26:42.208 --> 26:43.083
You can have it.

26:43.166 --> 26:47.208
Our channel, it's yours.
Just stop. Stop doing this.

26:57.375 --> 26:59.125
Announce it in a video.

27:00.750 --> 27:02.208
Tell everyone.

27:19.458 --> 27:23.375
I hear that streamers are all the craze
amongst the younger generation.

27:24.500 --> 27:26.125
Um, yeah, they are.

27:26.208 --> 27:27.916
They're even recognized by society now.

27:28.000 --> 27:30.916
It's a cop-out for losers
who can't land a real job.

27:39.333 --> 27:41.583
RUMI
72,000 FOLLOWERS

27:43.791 --> 27:44.833
Here.

27:44.916 --> 27:47.666
My follower account
has stopped growing lately.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.416
You'll have times like that.

27:50.916 --> 27:52.291
What should I do?

27:53.041 --> 27:53.958
Hmm.

27:54.625 --> 27:58.583
Well, it costs money to get exposure
and to promote you, you see.

28:00.291 --> 28:03.666
If you took on more jobs,
the cost can be offset.

28:04.583 --> 28:07.166
Well, that's what I'll do.
I'll take on more jobs.

28:07.250 --> 28:11.333
Will you? Really?
Ah, that would help out a lot.

28:11.416 --> 28:12.916
Our sponsors are important.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.541
I'll do it. What is it?

28:18.000 --> 28:19.541
The job is simple.

28:24.541 --> 28:26.958
That was a disaster, wasn't it?

28:28.458 --> 28:31.208
Things are just getting too dangerous.

28:32.291 --> 28:33.166
We're

28:34.333 --> 28:36.666
just not cut out for this, I think.

28:41.041 --> 28:42.416
I'm not buying it.

28:43.125 --> 28:43.958
Huh?

28:50.250 --> 28:52.333
I didn't want to hand it over.

28:53.166 --> 28:55.750
That's our channel. It belongs to us.

29:01.958 --> 29:04.541
When you took on Hamaken,

29:05.916 --> 29:06.833
I,

29:07.791 --> 29:10.333
truthfully, was very moved.

29:11.416 --> 29:14.541
If we're weak and even made fun of,

29:15.291 --> 29:17.125
that it's okay to be brave.

29:17.625 --> 29:19.375
Miracles can happen.

29:20.166 --> 29:21.791
So how can you…

29:23.208 --> 29:25.916
say that you'll give up
the channel so easily?

29:31.333 --> 29:32.458
Is that…

29:33.541 --> 29:36.541
how little you care for Viral Hit
and all we've done?

29:39.166 --> 29:40.625
Yeah, it is.

29:41.416 --> 29:44.041
There's no point
taking on a guy like that for real.

29:45.041 --> 29:46.208
I'm not an idiot.

29:51.458 --> 29:52.791
Are you okay?

29:59.625 --> 30:00.750
What's wrong?

30:04.208 --> 30:05.458
Go away.

30:06.083 --> 30:07.000
What are you saying?

30:07.083 --> 30:08.916
-Aki came all this way--
-Just go!

30:10.625 --> 30:11.625
Get outta here.

30:14.333 --> 30:15.833
Come on, let's go.

30:28.500 --> 30:30.583
Ah! Ah!

30:31.625 --> 30:33.958
Stop it! You're gonna kill him!

30:50.000 --> 30:52.500
I am such an idiot.

30:53.750 --> 30:56.416
When Shinjo sets his sights on a target,

30:56.500 --> 30:57.833
he attacks their friends

30:58.375 --> 31:00.666
rather than the target themselves.

31:02.250 --> 31:04.208
In front of the target.

31:06.666 --> 31:08.583
He's a real psychopath who gets a rush

31:08.666 --> 31:13.333
from leaving his opponents
totally helpless and also humiliated.

31:15.166 --> 31:16.666
And they…

31:18.958 --> 31:20.291
They say…

31:20.791 --> 31:23.666
he murdered
a fellow delinquent a few years ago.

31:24.333 --> 31:26.291
He was released
due to lack of evidence,

31:26.375 --> 31:28.541
but no one has been charged
with the killing.

31:28.625 --> 31:31.375
That's how dangerous he is.

31:33.875 --> 31:35.333
Someone like that…

31:36.125 --> 31:37.250
I won't fight.

31:52.375 --> 31:54.708
That's our channel. It belongs to us.

31:56.916 --> 31:58.250
Is that

31:59.083 --> 32:02.166
how little you care
for Viral Hit and all we've done?

32:20.250 --> 32:21.666
Uploaded the video yet?

32:22.750 --> 32:23.708
Not yet.

32:30.125 --> 32:33.583
As I promised,
you can have that channel to yourself.

32:34.208 --> 32:36.791
But… I have one condition.

32:38.833 --> 32:40.083
You must defeat me

32:41.041 --> 32:43.000
in a fight one month from now.

32:48.541 --> 32:50.333
Just say time and place

32:52.000 --> 32:53.250
when you actually decide.

32:59.750 --> 33:01.958
So that's how it is.

33:02.041 --> 33:03.125
Huh?

33:03.833 --> 33:06.833
What the hell are you thinking?
I told you not to do this.

33:06.916 --> 33:09.041
-I know, but I have.
-Take it back! Immediately!

33:09.125 --> 33:11.250
It's too late. We've already agreed on it.

33:14.083 --> 33:15.250
I knew it.

33:16.708 --> 33:17.708
You are an idiot.

33:17.791 --> 33:19.375
You keep quiet.

33:19.916 --> 33:23.125
Well, I'll be off.
I gotta start my training, yeah.

33:23.208 --> 33:24.833
Hey. Wait, Shimura.

33:26.375 --> 33:29.541
This time, you might not
just walk away with injuries.

33:30.500 --> 33:33.708
So, why… are you doing this?

33:35.583 --> 33:37.708
For money. Why else would I?

33:42.750 --> 33:44.375
You must be kidding!

33:44.458 --> 33:46.916
You just took an entire month off.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.791
Yes, I'm sorry.

33:48.875 --> 33:51.250
So, how long do you want
to take off this time?

33:51.333 --> 33:52.916
About the same.

33:53.000 --> 33:54.750
Shimura!

33:54.833 --> 33:57.583
Are you secretly studying abroad
or something like that?

33:57.666 --> 34:00.666
-Who takes leave from a part-time job?
-I'm very sorry.

34:00.750 --> 34:02.541
What… now you're gonna run?

34:04.208 --> 34:06.375
Shimura! Huh!

34:06.458 --> 34:07.666
Asamiya!

34:07.750 --> 34:09.875
I talked to the manager about your shift.

34:09.958 --> 34:11.750
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

34:11.833 --> 34:12.708
Mm.

34:13.875 --> 34:16.041
Is this another fight?

34:16.125 --> 34:16.958
Mm.

34:17.541 --> 34:18.791
Oh, don't worry though.

34:18.875 --> 34:21.166
I've got someone I can count on.

34:21.250 --> 34:23.125
-I see.
-Mm.

34:23.875 --> 34:29.916
Tell me, would you still…
do it if your friend… wasn't there?

34:30.500 --> 34:33.000
Why are you asking me that?

34:33.083 --> 34:37.541
Well, you keep challenging
tougher opponents. I'm worried.

34:38.041 --> 34:40.291
Oh, that's nice.

34:42.125 --> 34:45.666
I was wondering…
whether we could go out again

34:45.750 --> 34:47.750
when my next fight is over?

34:47.833 --> 34:52.500
I want to tell you what I couldn't
the last time we met.

34:54.541 --> 34:55.875
Of course!

34:56.500 --> 34:57.583
It's a date, okay?

34:59.458 --> 35:01.416
Mm. Okay, deal!

35:01.500 --> 35:03.541
Mm.

35:16.750 --> 35:18.125
Tae kwon do?

35:18.208 --> 35:20.916
I need to learn so I can win this thing.

35:21.500 --> 35:26.291
Well… if you can stop him
from using his legs,

35:26.375 --> 35:27.750
you might have a chance at winning.

35:27.833 --> 35:29.958
Stop him using his legs.

35:30.041 --> 35:34.791
But… that's not something
a novice can accomplish in a month.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.583
Yeah, I figured that.

35:38.666 --> 35:42.666
-Hey, Tatsuya. Time for a spa.
-Okay.

35:42.750 --> 35:46.125
-Oh, sorry, I interrupted.
-No worries. Happy to help you.

35:46.208 --> 35:47.208
Thanks.

35:48.583 --> 35:50.291
-Here you go.
-Let's do it.

35:59.666 --> 36:01.416
Oh, nothing.

36:11.291 --> 36:12.750
He's here, Sir.

36:14.291 --> 36:15.750
This way.

36:20.375 --> 36:21.750
That's BAD FELLOWS.

36:21.833 --> 36:22.750
Who are they?

36:22.833 --> 36:23.791
You don't know?

36:23.875 --> 36:28.375
It's a super popular show that pits
amateur fighters against each other.

36:29.625 --> 36:32.958
-Are you Shimura from Viral Hit?
-Uh, yes.

36:35.500 --> 36:38.625
I'm the representative of BAD FELLOWS,

36:39.125 --> 36:40.291
I'm Kuwata.

36:40.375 --> 36:42.958
Oh, yes. I've heard of you.

36:43.458 --> 36:44.750
That makes things easier.

36:44.833 --> 36:46.375
What do you say?

36:47.166 --> 36:49.708
Would you star in our show?

36:49.791 --> 36:50.916
Hey?

36:51.000 --> 36:53.750
You could become
even more famous than you are now.

36:54.750 --> 36:55.666
Oh

36:56.916 --> 36:58.458
Uh, wow.

36:58.541 --> 37:00.666
Sorry, I'm not interested
in that kind of thing.

37:00.750 --> 37:01.916
Hmm?

37:02.000 --> 37:05.916
I guess it's just… I mean, I'm not looking
to become a professional fighter.

37:06.000 --> 37:08.541
And I'm not interested in becoming famous.

37:09.541 --> 37:10.458
Okay.

37:12.333 --> 37:15.416
Well… if you ever do need money,

37:15.916 --> 37:17.375
please come to me anytime.

37:17.458 --> 37:18.916
I'd be glad to help you.

37:30.958 --> 37:31.833
Hmm.

37:32.708 --> 37:33.875
-And there you are.
-Thank you.

37:33.958 --> 37:34.791
There's your change.

37:34.875 --> 37:36.416
-Thank you very much.
-Thank you so much.

37:36.500 --> 37:38.583
-Thanks, have a nice day.
-That was delicious.

37:42.041 --> 37:45.291
Okay, who's next?

37:45.375 --> 37:46.791
Dad.

37:49.541 --> 37:51.416
VIRAL HIT'S HOT GIRLFRIEND!

37:54.458 --> 37:56.875
You're so annoying, you piece of trash!

37:56.958 --> 37:59.458
I'm not a loser,
but you're a loser for sure!

38:18.500 --> 38:20.916
Any more would be dangerous.

38:21.000 --> 38:21.833
LOGAN

38:38.500 --> 38:40.791
NEW VIDEO FROM HOW_TO_FIGHT

38:45.625 --> 38:49.583
HOW A NOVICE CAN BEAT
A TAE KWON DO FIGHTER

38:54.958 --> 38:57.125
ONE MONTH LATER

39:14.291 --> 39:15.375
Let's go.

39:20.708 --> 39:21.541
They say

39:22.500 --> 39:25.458
he murdered
a fellow delinquent a few years ago.

39:53.875 --> 39:56.083
What? Shimura, where are you going?

39:56.166 --> 39:57.166
He's fast.

40:12.541 --> 40:14.833
Fighting mindset, rule number one.

40:16.208 --> 40:18.083
Make your opponent lose his cool.

40:18.666 --> 40:20.291
You little…

40:22.041 --> 40:23.166
What are you doing?

40:24.125 --> 40:27.166
You stay here. We'll use this to talk.

40:27.250 --> 40:29.208
But why can't I come?

40:29.291 --> 40:31.166
I want to handle this alone.

40:32.458 --> 40:35.416
I don't want you to see me…
when I'm frightened.

40:37.125 --> 40:38.458
IT'S ALREADY STARTED!

40:38.541 --> 40:39.458
GO! SHIMURA!

40:39.541 --> 40:40.833
IS HE SPRAYING WATER?

40:40.916 --> 40:42.500
I NEED YOU TO WIN, SHIMURA

40:42.583 --> 40:43.750
I'M SWEATING LOLOL

40:43.833 --> 40:45.041
IT'S HAPPENING!!!

40:59.666 --> 41:01.625
Keep your eyes shut, and you're dead.

41:02.333 --> 41:05.708
How to beat a tae kwon do fighter,
rule one.

41:06.750 --> 41:09.583
Take control of the space
so they can't use their feet.

41:15.666 --> 41:16.500
Dumbass.

41:16.583 --> 41:18.916
You thought you could win
by splashing water?

41:21.625 --> 41:23.625
What made you think I'd only kick?

41:29.333 --> 41:32.291
This is… a fight, right?

41:44.583 --> 41:45.791
You're right.

41:45.875 --> 41:47.875
This is a fight.

41:51.208 --> 41:52.833
WHY ISN'T SHIMURA SLIPPING?

41:52.916 --> 41:54.416
HE'S WEARING WATER SHOES!

41:54.500 --> 41:56.000
THAT'S SNEAKY LOL

42:06.958 --> 42:09.250
It's not over yet. We've barely begun.

42:19.000 --> 42:22.666
Nothing in the world frustrates
a kicker a more

42:23.750 --> 42:25.333
than a tackle.

42:26.708 --> 42:31.625
The key to a successful tackle is
to grab the back of the knees.

42:31.708 --> 42:35.125
Grab and pull
at the back of your opponent's knees.

42:35.208 --> 42:41.083
You can take down even a large opponent.
This is the double leg tackle!

42:41.750 --> 42:42.875
Yeah!

42:44.625 --> 42:50.291
If the takedown is successful,
your odds jump past 50%.

42:51.666 --> 42:56.625
But you must never swing
your fist from above.

42:57.291 --> 43:01.416
You only get one chance
against a martial opponent.

43:01.916 --> 43:04.750
You must finish them off in one blow.

43:07.416 --> 43:10.333
Put your hand behind your opponent's neck,

43:10.416 --> 43:13.416
grab their collar and pull them close.

43:23.416 --> 43:27.500
Even if your opponent resists,
don't let go!

43:28.375 --> 43:31.500
This is a technique
that compresses the carotid artery.

43:31.583 --> 43:33.416
The cross choke!

43:33.500 --> 43:37.458
It takes ten seconds
for your opponent to pass out.

43:37.541 --> 43:40.875
So, count it out in your head.

43:42.166 --> 43:43.208
One…

43:43.708 --> 43:44.916
Two…

43:45.000 --> 43:46.375
-Yeah!
-Three…

43:47.041 --> 43:48.125
Four…

43:48.958 --> 43:50.125
Five…

43:50.208 --> 43:51.916
Six…

43:52.500 --> 43:53.458
Seven…

43:53.958 --> 43:55.208
Eight…

43:55.708 --> 43:57.291
Nine…

43:59.041 --> 43:59.875
HUH?

43:59.958 --> 44:03.083
SHINJO DOESN'T LOOK WORRIED

44:03.166 --> 44:04.791
YOU'RE RIGHT LOLOL

44:06.333 --> 44:09.208
That's bad, the choke came off.

44:10.625 --> 44:11.750
Idiot.

44:12.708 --> 44:15.041
You didn't land it right.

44:18.625 --> 44:19.625
Shimura!

44:20.125 --> 44:21.250
ALMOST HAD IT!

44:21.333 --> 44:22.708
YOU WERE SO CLOSE!

44:22.791 --> 44:26.166
Oh no.
Shinjo allowed the hold deliberately.

44:27.041 --> 44:28.041
Huh?

44:29.208 --> 44:31.708
You really thought I'd fall for that move?

44:34.708 --> 44:36.125
This is what I wanted.8

44:40.833 --> 44:42.666
Remember, the only way

44:42.750 --> 44:45.333
for an amateur to beat
a tae kwon do fighter

44:45.416 --> 44:47.833
is to steal their kicks.

44:48.666 --> 44:50.875
Now I can use the legs.

44:52.666 --> 44:57.750
And if you fail to do that,
there's only one thing left to do.

44:59.375 --> 45:02.791
Run for your life!

45:07.416 --> 45:08.958
Shimura!

45:09.041 --> 45:11.291
It's too dangerous. Run!

45:13.291 --> 45:14.833
I'm such an idiot.

45:15.708 --> 45:17.833
Especially after all of that practice.

45:31.083 --> 45:32.375
Oh shit.

45:32.458 --> 45:34.708
This guy, he's gonna kill Shimura.

46:18.416 --> 46:25.416
VIRAL HIT
